WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A myrtle branch has specific leaf pattern

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.720
requirements.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.580
Notice the actual structure before choosing.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.560
Careful observation is more useful than assuming

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.560
that every green branch qualifies.
